{
  "song_id": 52220,
  "title": "Bells of DOOM",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": ", ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"I'll show the world and, more particularly, those dim-witted, no-talent studio execs, that I...I'll prove that I'm the greatest soundman of all time!\"",
          "rhyme": "ajm",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah... don't worry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "\"He was a recording genius who invented this gizmo that turns bells into bombs, or something?\"",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "\"Wow. Gotta get outta the way of the sound waves of those bells!\"",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCD",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABBC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Who got the most whips, gats, and cash?",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "If you ask the Villain, he say, \"Who gives a rat's ass?",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Can't take it wit' you when you breathe your last",
          "rhyme": "ast",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "In the meaning, in between – pass that grass\"",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Give thanks, his rank is that of big stank dank",
          "rhyme": "#k",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "He often time drank by the river bank",
          "rhyme": "#k",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And kept a silver shank for a calm cat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Always stay strapped for hand-to-arm combat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "For DOOM, the bell tolls",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Let them fools know ain't no more room in these hell holes",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "It's filled up to the brim with sold souls",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Crackheads, dope fiends, and 40's of Old Gold",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Hold up – the boldest who ever sold it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Whoever dare roll up, prepare to get folded",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Like Holly Hobbie, \"gosh, golly, gee\"",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "The back of Hector Hoskovitz's trolly read \"Wash me\" (\"Ha, ha, ha, ha...\")",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Dagnabbit, the mask is like a chick magnet",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Some'll let you stab it for a knick of the babbit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "They say he talk slick like Dick Cavett",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "A fiend for the mic and can't kick it like a sick habit (\"The bells...!\")",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Give him a hero's holla",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Along wit' more free dough than Creflo Dollar",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Holy Toledo, how he made base on The Today Show?",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "They say he wear a mask in case his face show",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "It's better than a stocking, birdbrain",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Find him on the corner, rockin' \"Mockin' Bird Lane\"",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "He's a odd man, Grandma",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "And she's a bad mamma-jamma",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Either squeeze the damn hammer – or stop complaining",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "On the top, he's remaining",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "A lot of Pop sensations need more proper home training",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "The people say he's the nicest",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "He only wants to be left alone to his own devices",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "If the price is right, he might sing a new smash",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Then laugh and twist his Rollie Fingers moustache",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Tear ya crew a new–gash",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "And prepare a new batch of his own Special Herb goulash",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Villain – the dork who talk funny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "And he'll put one in ya, so watch where you walk, money",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Like Semmi say – do more boomers, they cure tumors",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "And beware the DOOM-ster!",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCBDDEEFFGHIJKLMKIKENOOPQEERRRSTAAAAKMUJ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAAABBAACCDCEFEGHEEEAAIIJAAAEEEHEAAAAEHCF"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "outro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"The bells toll for you! Ha, ha, ha, ha...\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "A",
      "rhyme_vowel": "A"
    }
  ]
}